{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09647","headline":"安西馆中思长安 · 岑参","name":"安西馆中思长安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家在日出处，朝来起东风。\n风从帝乡来，不异家信通。\n绝域地欲尽，孤城天遂穷。\n弥年但走马，终日随飘蓬。\n寂寞不得意，辛勤方在公。\n胡尘净古塞，兵气屯边空。\n乡路眇天外，归期如梦中。\n遥凭长房术，爲缩天山东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}